    "name": "SpellChain",
    "steam_appid": 3573120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpellChain is a first-person spell crafting action game set in a whimsical kingdom determined to rid its lands of sorcery. Leave a wake of hand-crafted destruction as you embark on a magical crusade to slay a king you don't like very much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b7da9d8e38ef4ac4541ec9a1ec10fe11.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b7da9d8e38ef4ac4541ec9a1ec10fe11.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b7da9d8e38ef4ac4541ec9a1ec10fe11.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Magic Unleash Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the comforts of your cozy (but still evil) wizard tower, get creative arranging your Spellbook effectively then chain your magics together on the fly however you choose. Practice &amp; experiment in your training grounds before unleashing your Spell Chains on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f18702169a2f1c7e34dfdf1e8f64817f.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f18702169a2f1c7e34dfdf1e8f64817f.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f18702169a2f1c7e34dfdf1e8f64817f.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot Up &amp; Prepare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some time to relax,\u00a0try on some new hats, check if last year's robe still fits. Customize your wizard's appearance to increase the effectiveness of your spells or just to impress your enemies with your sharp dresswork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/13ac4509d0179fa6f4c8683241572f43.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/13ac4509d0179fa6f4c8683241572f43.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/13ac4509d0179fa6f4c8683241572f43.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Wizardly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trim your beard, smoke your slightly too long pipe, stare menacingly out across the lands from your tower balcony... Gain power-boosting buffs before every fight by acting &quot;Wizardly&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/0278b4271cb7b9dcdba567aee4535782.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/0278b4271cb7b9dcdba567aee4535782.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/0278b4271cb7b9dcdba567aee4535782.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpellChain is a first-person spell crafting action game set in a whimsical kingdom determined to rid its lands of sorcery. Leave a wake of hand-crafted destruction as you embark on a magical crusade to slay a king you don't like very much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b7da9d8e38ef4ac4541ec9a1ec10fe11.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b7da9d8e38ef4ac4541ec9a1ec10fe11.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b7da9d8e38ef4ac4541ec9a1ec10fe11.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Magic Unleash Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the comforts of your cozy (but still evil) wizard tower, get creative arranging your Spellbook effectively then chain your magics together on the fly however you choose. Practice &amp; experiment in your training grounds before unleashing your Spell Chains on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f18702169a2f1c7e34dfdf1e8f64817f.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f18702169a2f1c7e34dfdf1e8f64817f.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f18702169a2f1c7e34dfdf1e8f64817f.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot Up &amp; Prepare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some time to relax,\u00a0try on some new hats, check if last year's robe still fits. Customize your wizard's appearance to increase the effectiveness of your spells or just to impress your enemies with your sharp dresswork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/13ac4509d0179fa6f4c8683241572f43.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/13ac4509d0179fa6f4c8683241572f43.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/13ac4509d0179fa6f4c8683241572f43.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Wizardly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trim your beard, smoke your slightly too long pipe, stare menacingly out across the lands from your tower balcony... Gain power-boosting buffs before every fight by acting &quot;Wizardly&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/0278b4271cb7b9dcdba567aee4535782.poster.avif?t=1743744800\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/0278b4271cb7b9dcdba567aee4535782.webm?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/0278b4271cb7b9dcdba567aee4535782.mp4?t=1743744800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Wield the power to craft your own spells by chaining together Magical forces. Create fireballs that summon storms, lightning bolts of poison, or blizzards that hail meteors. Destroy, Loot, Spell-Craft and reach The King so you can have a stern word with him.",
